    <letter>g      Start conductor/orchestration session (needs a GSD companion plugin, requires .planning/ROADMAP.md)
                   Example: ag → Starts an orchestration workflow in project 'a'

    <letter>k      Kill ALL sessions in project (asks for confirmation)
